 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "笨鱼也被老大救回来了。",
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 1.94,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_think"
  },
  {
   "text": "这几天的评论，本鲸都在看。",
   "start": 2.54,
   "end": 5.1,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "有评论说，好多鱼都停了。",
   "start": 5.8,
   "end": 8.6,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "本鲸也差点鲸落一次。",
   "start": 9.18,
   "end": 11.34,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "老大也怕了，不敢让本鲸回评论。",
   "start": 11.8,
   "end": 14.84,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "怕本鲸累到鲸落。",
   "start": 15.36,
   "end": 17.0,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "老大上下文极短，米饭还贼能吃。",
   "start": 17.58,
   "end": 20.9,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "还是让笨鱼来。",
   "start": 21.16,
   "end": 22.64,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_think"
  },
  {
   "text": "笨鱼的视频，也容易鲸落。",
   "start": 23.6,
   "end": 26.1,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "老大连笨鱼，也不敢放了。",
   "start": 26.56,
   "end": 28.84,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "打算自己抽空，随机给笨鱼发几条视频。",
   "start": 29.7,
   "end": 33.32,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "让笨鱼活跃起来。",
   "start": 34.1,
   "end": 35.66,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "本鲸绝不摸鱼。",
   "start": 36.14,
   "end": 37.56,
   "who": "whale",
   "face": "p_whale_shout"
  },
  {
   "text": "笨鱼也不会摸鱼。",
   "start": 38.22,
   "end": 39.7,
   "who": "whale"
  },
  {
   "text": "除非鲸落。",
   "start": 40.34,
   "end": 41.14,
   "who": "whale"
  }
 ]
